<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Player</title>
<style>body {margin: 0;background: #000;color: #fff;display: flex;flex-direction: column;align-items: center;justify-content: center;height: 100vh;font-family: Arial,sans-serif;}
.card {background: rgba(0,0,0,.85);padding: 25px 20px;border-radius: 24px;backdrop-filter: blur(10px);width: min(320px, 90vw);text-align: center;border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);box-sizing:border-box;}
h1 {font-size: 13px;font-weight: 300;margin-top: 0;margin-bottom: 20px;}
.piano-player {background: linear-gradient(#1f1f1f, #000000);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);border-radius: 12px;padding: 18px;width: 100%;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);}
.player-bar {background: #111111;height: 4px;border-radius: 2px;cursor: pointer;margin-bottom: 15px;width: 100%;}
.player-progress {background: #ffffff;box-shadow: 0 0 6px #ffffff;height: 100%;width: 0%;transition: width 0.1s linear;}
.player-btn {background: none;border: none;color: #ffffff;font-size: 24px;cursor: pointer;opacity: 0.7;transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s;padding: 0;line-height: 1;}
.player-btn:hover {opacity: 1;transform:scale(1.1);}</style></head><body>
<div class="card"><h1>Being hurt is part of being alive.</h1><div class="piano-player"><div class="player-bar" onclick="seekTrack(event)"><div class="player-progress" id="trackProgress"></div></div><button class="player-btn"id="playerToggleBtn"onclick="togglePlayback()">▶</button></div></div>
